  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.40 Miscellaneous stationary VOC source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.40 \"Miscellaneous stationary VOC source\" means any stationary source of VOCs which has at least one unclassifiable core process or device but which might also include any number of classifiable core processes or devices.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
